# LifeOS Deployment Checklist

## Phase 1: Project Setup (Day 1-2)

### 1.1 Initialize Project
- [ ] Create Next.js 15+ app with App Router:
  ```bash
  npx create-next-app@latest lifeos --typescript --tailwind --app --eslint
  ```
- [ ] Install core dependencies:
  ```bash
  npm install prisma @prisma/client next-auth stripe twilio
  npm install -D @types/node @types/react
  ```
- [ ] Set up folder structure:
  ```
  apps/web/
    app/
      (auth)/
      dashboard/
      preferences/
      secretary/
      api/
    components/
    hooks/
    lib/
  packages/db/
  ```

### 1.2 Database Setup
- [ ] Set up Postgres database (Supabase/Neon/Railway)
- [ ] Copy `prisma_schema_updated.prisma` to `prisma/schema.prisma`
- [ ] Add `DATABASE_URL` to `.env.local`
- [ ] Run:
  ```bash
  npx prisma generate
  npx prisma db push
  ```
- [ ] Verify tables created in DB admin panel

### 1.3 Environment Variables
Create `.env.local` with:
```bash
# Database
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://..."

# Auth
NEXTAUTH_SECRET="your-secret-key-min-32-chars"
NEXTAUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# Stripe
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY="sk_test_..."
NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="pk_test_..."
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET="whsec_..."
STRIPE_PRICE_ID_PREMIUM_MONTHLY="price_..."

# AI
OPENAI_API_KEY="sk-..."

# Twilio
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID="AC..."
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN="..."
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER="+1..."

# Integrations
PLAID_CLIENT_ID="..."
PLAID_SECRET="..."
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY="..."
SENDGRID_API_KEY="SG..."

# App
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL="http://localhost:3000"
```

